Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.97,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}玩《最后生还者》还太早呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.27,0:03:02.95,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}今天的日子 也很快会成为纪念日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:04.59,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}步步为营虎视眈眈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.59,0:03:05.89,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}狠狠地咬住不放吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:07.18,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}就保持扑克脸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:08.61,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}继续前进吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.14,0:03:11.48,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}还是一如既往地狂妄自大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:13.69,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}真是不可爱呢 我和你
